/P 51 0 R
/E (AI agents can read documents, call tools, search repositories and take actions on behalf of users. Untrusted emails, pages, retrieved files or tool responses may contain instructions intended to redirect an agent, disclose secrets or misuse a permitted tool. Traditional filtering of user prompts does not establish trustworthy boundaries for tool permissions. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [6]
>>
